<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-MARSEILLE BEAT AUXERRE 3-0 IN FRENCH LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MARSEILLE BEAT AUXERRE 3-0 IN FRENCH LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>MARSEILLE 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marseille beat Auxerre 3-0 (halftime 1-0) in their French first division match at the Velodrome on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Xavier Gravelaine (39), Marc Libbra (83), Hamada Jambay (86)</p>
<p>Attendance: 19,000</p>
